{"segs": ["PA_ja_199:0.4", "PA_ja_199:1.1"], "en": "9. The Gahapatijātaka “Neither of these two is acceptable to me;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_199:1.2"], "en": "neither of these two is pleasing to me.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_199:1.3"], "en": "When she has descended into the granary and says,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_199:1.4"], "en": "\"I did not see it,\" I call that,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_199:2.1"], "en": "O village headman, begging.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_199:2.2"], "en": "What is the worth of this meager life?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_199:2.3"], "en": "Having made a pact for two months,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_199:2.4"], "en": "[I ate] the flesh of a lean, aged ox.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_199:2.5"], "en": "\"To accuse me at an improper time—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_199:2.6"], "en": "that too does not please me.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_199:3.1"], "en": "The Ninth Jātaka, the Householder Jātaka.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
